                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is basically \"The Adventure of Lolo\" with a rather nice coat of paint.  Nearly all of its critters and devices are present and given a facelift, but I've counted three differences after playing the first few levels.\nMaking that connection was enough for me to buy this game.\n\nBasically, it's a sort of living block puzzle--you need to pick up all the panels to open the chest, but you have to do so without either trapping yourself or falling victim to baddies.  Push blocks, freeze (and push) foes, and occasionally forge a new path through.\n\nSee you at the top!",
